  "overview": "Korea Design System — Crisp light (#ffffff) canvas, system-ui typography, #ecf2fe brand accent, and 8px corner geometry",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (#ffffff) canvas paired with `#ffffff` component surfaces and `#0b0b0c` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#ecf2fe` with `#0b0b0c` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `system-ui` across 46 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
}
